{"ticker":"AMAT","updated":"2026-10-30T22:33:42Z","profile":{"longName":"Applied Materials, Inc.","shortName":"Applied Materials, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"United States","website":"https://www.appliedmaterials.com","fullTimeEmployees":38900,"marketCap":309574434816,"trailingPE":33.657463,"forwardPE":21.023851,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":10.039058,"pegRatio":0.89,"targetMeanPrice":627.8333,"targetHighPrice":900.0,"targetLowPrice":358.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":36,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.248,"earningsGrowth":0.428,"grossMargins":0.49398,"operatingMargins":0.33736,"profitMargins":0.30052,"totalRevenue":30837000192,"beta":1.591,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":739.67,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":203.4,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.5},"summary":"Applied Materials, Inc. provides materials engineering solutions, equipment, services, and software to the semiconductor and related industries in the United States, China, Korea, Taiwan, Japan, Southeast Asia, Europe, and internationally. The company operates through Semiconductor Systems and Applied Global Services (AGS) segments. The Semiconductor Systems segment includes semiconductor capital equipment to enable materials engineering steps, including etch, rapid thermal processing, deposition, chemical mechanical planarization, metrology and inspection, wafer packaging, and ion implantation. The AGS segment offers integrated solutions to optimize equipment and fab performance and productivity comprising spares, upgrades, services, and 200 millimeter and other equipment and factory automation software for semiconductor and other products. It serves manufacturers of semiconductor wafers and chips, and other electronic devices. Applied Materials, Inc. was incorporated in 1967 and is headquartered in Santa Clara, California.","summary_zh":"應用材料公司為美國、中國、韓國、台灣、日本、東南亞、歐洲和國際的半導體及相關產業提供材料工程解決方案、設備、服務和軟體。該公司透過半導體系統和應用全球服務（AGS）部門營運。半導體系統部門包括半導體資本設備，以實現材料工程步驟，包括蝕刻、快速熱處理、沉積、化學機械平坦化、計量和檢測、晶圓封裝和離子注入。 AGS 部門提供整合解決方案，以優化設備和晶圓廠的性能和生產力，包括備件、升級、服務以及用於半導體和其他產品的 200 毫米及其他設備和工廠自動化軟體。它為半導體晶圓和晶片以及其他電子設備的製造商提供服務。應用材料公司成立於 1967 年，總部位於加州聖克拉拉。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體設備與材料","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":156.72,"h":158.3,"l":156.01,"c":157.57,"v":7683400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":158.05,"h":158.05,"l":154.47,"c":156.25,"v":7335000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":155.94,"h":159.67,"l":155.4,"c":158.24,"v":6245100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":160.26,"h":162.85,"l":158.82,"c":162.75,"v":7046800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":163.81,"h":164.65,"l":161.85,"c":162.05,"v":7933600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":161.92,"h":164.26,"l":161.75,"c":163.5,"v":5315400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":164.3,"h":165.4,"l":162.55,"c":163.42,"v":5690200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":164.0,"h":170.66,"l":164.0,"c":170.15,"v":8999900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":167.91,"h":169.67,"l":167.18,"c":167.8,"v":5170600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":169.11,"h":171.06,"l":168.53,"c":170.93,"v":5597600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":172.46,"h":174.1,"l":171.58,"c":173.54,"v":6447500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":174.25,"h":179.55,"l":173.97,"c":178.13,"v":9588300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":188.0,"h":191.55,"l":183.83,"c":189.76,"v":15473700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":190.82,"h":191.85,"l":188.66,"c":190.1,"v":18903500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":193.19,"h":201.15,"l":192.43,"c":200.52,"v":15475500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":201.23,"h":204.1,"l":198.8,"c":200.87,"v":12417900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":199.08,"h":203.75,"l":197.4,"c":201.44,"v":6360500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":199.04,"h":200.72,"l":196.2,"c":199.6,"v":6027600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":200.0,"h":205.2,"l":197.39,"c":203.92,"v":7363300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":206.34,"h":210.5,"l":204.68,"c":204.95,"v":9295400},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":204.36,"h":210.27,"l":202.87,"c":204.74,"v":12253800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":204.74,"h":218.44,"l":203.61,"c":217.74,"v":12699200},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":225.0,"h":226.41,"l":218.73,"c":223.59,"v":11166000},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":219.91,"